ose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":208,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:104:208:sha256-d1c834d94baefaaad4aefccc6107f59273e4814c17dc14d15cd69b1ef7773f22\",\"quote\":\"(1) It is acceptable if the infant's eyes, particularly a newborn's, are partially or completely closed;\",\"start\":104}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:26c0e4145f5a99b11242064be6e61274452923efd6fa77129ffc211e6c8c2676\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"partially or completely closed\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d5e248da5512413b01d3be950de993bee90a0927f0bfa8ee5218f587267083f9\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"is acceptable\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:64cf49bafc604774a5b8c4e3871aead9a5ea9b663f91d34e02d8a16d232db1b1\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(1) It is acceptable if the infant's eyes, particularly a newborn's, are partially or completely closed;\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:8839ac895333b97e4c9f46228d2e88d5ab6a07d6c6239346400ac87af64346a2\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"d. Infants pose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\",\"(1) It is acceptable if the infant's eyes, particularly a newborn's, are partially or completely closed;\"],\"scope_text\":\"In photographs of infants, particularly a newborn\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":104,\"summary\":\"In a photograph of an infant, it is acceptable if the infant's eyes, particularly a newborn's, are partially or completely closed.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
